    <solution><p>SOLUTION</p>
<p><me>\begin{array}{rcl} \displaystyle \int_0^{3} (5 e^x+5 \sin x)\, dx \amp =\amp   
\displaystyle  5 e^x-5 \cos x  \Big]_0^{3}
\\ \amp =\amp  (5 e^{3} - 5 \cos 3) - (5 e^0 - 5 \cos0 ) 
\\ \amp =\amp  5 e^{3} - 5 \cos 3 - 0 
\end{array}</me></p>
